nt with the foreground style, oriented to face forward toward the play space, and kept entirely within the rear 2 m depth so nothing crosses into the playable corridor. Downstream steps have latitude over the exact count, spacing, height profile, and decorative filler of the landforms and mountains, provided the layered depth ordering, the left-to-right motif shift, and the right-side castle silhouette anchor are preserved.

